{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-632670464543622117 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632670464476447717&sectionId=632670464543622117)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNCmsFqTTt_text","label":"ggNCmsFqTTt_text","default":"<p>Mother's Day is a chance to celebrate the women who have given us love, guidance, encouragement, and countless memories. While flowers and chocolates are classic choices, a personalized gift can make the celebration feel even more meaningful. This year, turn a favorite memory into a keepsake she can enjoy long after Mother's Day is over.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggu-kMSzBXe_text","label":"ggu-kMSzBXe_text","default":"<p>What Makes a Mother's Day Gift Truly Meaningful?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggG80MgXBzN_text","label":"ggG80MgXBzN_text","default":"<p>The most memorable gifts often have something personal behind them. A favorite photograph can bring back a special moment, a familiar smile, or a story that means something to the whole family.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead of choosing something simply because it is popular, consider giving Mom something connected to a memory you share. A personalized keepsake can show her that you did not just choose a gift. You chose a moment that represents how much she means to you.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Photos are often among the most treasured things we have. They capture birthdays, family trips, childhood milestones, celebrations, and ordinary moments that eventually become special memories.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Memobrick gives those photographs a new way to be enjoyed. A favorite family photo can be transformed into a personalized brick mosaic that Mom can build and proudly display in her home.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every time she sees it, she can remember the people and moments behind the picture.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbySm5k_ro_text","label":"ggbySm5k_ro_text","default":"<p><strong>Mother's Day Photo Ideas She Will Love</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghehI-L1yQ_text","label":"gghehI-L1yQ_text","default":"<p>The perfect Mother's Day photo does not have to be professionally taken. Sometimes the most meaningful pictures are the ones that capture a genuine moment between Mom and the people she loves.</p><p>Consider using:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A favorite photo of Mom with her children</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A family vacation memory</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A childhood photo with Mom</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A birthday or holiday celebration</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A candid family moment</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A favorite photo with grandchildren</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A wedding or anniversary photograph</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A funny family picture that always makes her smile</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Choose a photograph that already has a story behind it. That story is what makes the finished keepsake personal.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTXwKDdj2O_label","label":"ggTXwKDdj2O_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTXwKDdj2O_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggTXwKDdj2O_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out Of Stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTXwKDdj2O_unavailableLabel","label":"ggTXwKDdj2O_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTXwKDdj2O_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggTXwKDdj2O_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTXwKDdj2O_successMessage","label":"ggTXwKDdj2O_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTXwKDdj2O_errorMessage","label":"ggTXwKDdj2O_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggY9MYFYfq0_text","label":"ggY9MYFYfq0_text","default":"<p>Instead of simply opening a finished present, Mom can build the mosaic herself or enjoy creating it with her children and family. Sitting together and assembling the pieces can become another special Mother's Day memory.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As the photograph slowly comes together, you can talk about the moment it captured, share stories, and enjoy time together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The finished Memobrick then represents two memories. The original moment in the photograph and the experience of building it together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZV3yJl0yN_text","label":"ggZV3yJl0yN_text","default":"<p><strong>A Gift From the Whole Family</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXnUAcHzx__text","label":"ggXnUAcHzx__text","default":"<p>Mother's Day is often celebrated by the whole family, making a personalized photo keepsake especially meaningful.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Children can choose a favorite photo of Mom. Siblings can work together to create a family mosaic. Partners can select a photograph that celebrates their life together. Grandchildren can even help create a special keepsake for Grandma.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The result can be something that represents the people who make Mother's life special.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Flowers are beautiful, and cards can express heartfelt messages, but they eventually become part of the day that has passed.</p><p>A personalized Memobrick gives Mom something she can continue to display and enjoy. It transforms a photograph into a piece of personalized home décor that carries a story.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead of simply saying \"Happy Mother's Day,\" you can give her something that shows exactly why she is appreciated.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvHBrmJJrI_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggvHBrmJJrI_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/07bab032-5483-436e-b569-c296d6646df0.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvHBrmJJrI_alt","label":"ggvHBrmJJrI_alt","default":"Mother's Day Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvHBrmJJrI_title","label":"ggvHBrmJJrI_title","default":"Mother's Day Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggh11CGsJY7_text","label":"ggh11CGsJY7_text","default":"<p>Every mother has a different story, which means there is no single photograph that represents everyone.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For a new mom, choose a special photo with her child.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For a grandmother, choose a picture featuring her grandchildren.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For your own mom, choose a family memory that brings everyone together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For your partner, celebrate a special moment from your journey as parents.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For a mother who loves family traditions, choose a photograph that represents one of the moments she treasures most.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A personalized gift allows the photograph and the story behind it to make the present unique.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7oGzXp7Hd_text","label":"gg7oGzXp7Hd_text","default":"<p><strong>Frequently Asked Questions</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg602ICqtDX_text","label":"gg602ICqtDX_text","default":"<p>Is Memobrick a good Mother's Day gift?</p><p><strong>Yes. It turns a meaningful photograph into a personalized keepsake that Mom can build, display, and treasure.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What photo should I use for Mother's Day?</p><p><strong>Choose a clear photograph with good lighting and a meaningful connection to Mom. Family portraits, candid moments, and childhood memories can all work beautifully</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Can the whole family build it together?</p><p><strong>Absolutely. Building Memobrick together can turn the gift into a fun family activity and create another memory to remember</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Can I give Memobrick to a grandmother?</p><p><strong>Yes. A favorite photo of grandchildren, family gatherings, or special moments together can make a wonderful keepsake for Grandma</strong>.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsh_bsTDB7_text","label":"ggsh_bsTDB7_text","default":"<p>Mother's Day is about celebrating the love and memories that make a mother special. While traditional gifts can make her smile for a day, a personalized keepsake can remind her of those special moments for years to come.</p><p>Turn a favorite photograph into a Memobrick she can build, display, and treasure. Because sometimes the most meaningful way to say <strong>\"I love you, Mom\"</strong> is to give her a memory she can keep close every day.</p>"}],
